          "id": "502c0495467012911d97f9918ab8d6547eadb7101b86e3d91a1aed68f00efbb1",
          "time": "2026-09-17T02:32:10+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Warsh: This decision comes when the economy appears to be strengthening."
        },
        {
          "id": "e45cb6eab8972ac9cfcb8820a3a61ccdf0df71065633162db77b9e695a33d21a",
          "time": "2026-09-17T02:32:27+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Warsh: Key markers have improved in the recent months."
        },
        {
          "id": "8bef5daef409f9850fc86d3c3c99b604a80d7e22d9ac30a174f75952ec6ea92e",
          "time": "2026-09-17T02:32:43+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Chair Warsh: Credit flows have been robust."
        },
        {
          "id": "12391cee6ddd228e9ce5f9fc57ca2b8dad9f848afa2a68a54c497b86ac3c0cef",
          "time": "2026-09-17T02:33:02+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Chair Warsh: I am hard-pressed to call financial conditions restrictive. The view that conditions are not restrictive was widely shared by the FOMC."
        },
        {
          "id": "dcd702212d298336e1475800a5cc83b655425c82d87cabbe3e978ee80a98dbf1",
          "time": "2026-09-17T02:33:24+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Warsh: The economy is resilient."
        },
        {
          "id": "91b9947d22de6eb853b35bfb187587235b9345f8dc0f0899226ddbdba0d845b3",
          "time": "2026-09-17T02:33:34+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Warsh: The jobless rate remains low, openings and hours are increasing."
        },
        {
          "id": "a8c00176053c145afbe17283b8b44bd8fe96ea3fd4ce17cab2894717950813fe",
          "time": "2026-09-17T02:33:48+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Chair Warsh: The FOMC removed a dose of accomodation."
        },
        {
          "id": "65d018671476a03ae3ae007f5a349433eb547825444ac0c0001b9562b91d1300",
          "time": "2026-09-17T02:34:01+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Chair Warsh: The labor side of the Fed's remit is in good shape."
        },
        {
          "id": "7c6d5d83e291027bb61dff757ea362dfee5f41aaa19f3f9a1f29438b5fbfe3ef",
          "time": "2026-09-17T02:34:17+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Chair Warsh: The predominant focus of the Fed is on price stability."
        },
        {
          "id": "d7aa413e0e3720434d541db56485fe71fd04ce20fe64e9ff7877dd7a6bf72c24",
          "time": "2026-09-17T02:34:30+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Chair Warsh: Inflation is too high, and has been for too long."
        },
        {
          "id": "94c187d6f648b43a7bf034b5ac68e9183efdf088bdb346766300781cf8a31b4b",
          "time": "2026-09-17T02:34:46+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Chair Warsh: The summer data does not tell me that the inflation situation has improved."
        },
        {
          "id": "9a46ebb1f9b8eda109a0b7ec65b84974835920309f2f70d4c1c6a555343b2d03",
          "time": "2026-09-17T02:35:01+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Chair Warsh: There are too many categories that are posting increases above 3% on both 6 and 12 month basis."
        },
        {
          "id": "c7b7757527c9b33ec3b5ac92d094b838bad66441e4454acdf96cc7a4a27a1792",
          "time": "2026-09-17T02:35:21+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Chair Warsh: In July, we expressed a joint readiness to act."
        },
        {
          "id": "c3c3497350155222cd0f9c9f185734616f3290143011fdcf8746431f9add1d55",
          "time": "2026-09-17T02:35:57+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Chair Warsh: We must be confident that underlying inflation must be moving to 2% on a timely basis, and the FOMC decided this has not been met."
        },
        {
          "id": "017daa8ed1402c0ea1971fb1a00ef8f2114cf0ea9d2301f9cda97235982d91db",
          "time": "2026-09-17T02:36:29+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Chair Warsh: I did not submit a dot."
        },
        {
          "id": "78f1d20813b457dbc0becd9ab5e2629ba8189b5b5d676f556d90b2a95e0924af",
          "time": "2026-09-17T02:37:13+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Chair Warsh: Inflation risks are to the upside, labor risks are balanced."
        },
        {
          "id": "45da53a7857e6f34b4bea77930fb73e58f908896dcd7c19052a2c35d6dbbbe71",
          "time": "2026-09-17T02:38:58+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Chair Warsh: We will ensure any changes in prices won't broaden out."
        },
        {
          "id": "fca3e0f3c82c93682596720cdcf9f2f979f74a847dea62b9958bc6cbb03e9d13",
          "time": "2026-09-17T02:39:37+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Chair Warsh: I am not in the forward guidance business."
        },
        {
          "id": "bf874f0026d60456f05413d048d9c0def2e915c1b5d5d5334ccaaf185e0b8d8a",
          "time": "2026-09-17T02:39:50+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Chair Warsh: The decision we made today was a sober decision."
        },
        {
          "id": "811e25fe62eef19ea4597e16c6e39117eee7633511ab671b22d77943fc3e9ab4",
          "time": "2026-09-17T02:39:59+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Chair Warsh: I am not going to prejudge any future decision we may make."
        },
        {
          "id": "0881b7111529127d9e90dfaf3f58ea806a731edcfd81f440ce6cbe7ecf19e7b1",
          "time": "2026-09-17T02:42:24+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Chair Warsh: Because of the underlying strength of the economy, we can afford to focus on price stability."
        },
        {
          "id": "9939857aad356e70c9d23a00f213c2ac17e42bd18ebc07043f9de10f643812f2",
          "time": "2026-09-17T02:43:49+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Chair Warsh: What happened in 7 weeks since we last met, data has shown that the economy has strenghtened."
        },
        {
          "id": "6016de304ed63f2d376bee59619867a2e05291db3e4381086deb2d4a042dd590",
          "time": "2026-09-17T02:44:23+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Chair Warsh: Inflation trends were not passing the test, and I have seen little to change that."
        },
        {
          "id": "d5376e212b153194c70c44e4c28165ed1789aef4c6070e0e9817e3021e818c5a",
          "time": "2026-09-17T02:45:16+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Chair Warsh: My colleagues are hard-pressed to describe financial conditions as restrictive, so we decided to remove a dose of accommodation."
        },
        {
          "id": "62a83a1413f61e05a03f4908993caee5a9640f909a6216cbc442b819cb284d3d",
          "time": "2026-09-17T02:46:25+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Chair Warsh: I have always been interested in a neutral rate academically, but I don't see it having an operational effect on decisions today."
        },
        {
          "id": "dacf02d269acb8da1ba0280e38c122a1818d5c301e000a91626bdc1814a1dbfa",
          "time": "2026-09-17T02:47:29+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Chair Warsh: I was not waiting breathlessly on any one data point, including CPI."
        },
        {
          "id": "7ebfdc13bf3fe7aad0682f35c349f612655a8dd57bb2b62314ae8083465c45e4",
          "time": "2026-09-17T02:47:43+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Chair Warsh: Trends matter, data points are noisy."
        },
        {
          "id": "4267f22cdd2eb21022044c1c2c868abeeff65792f5b1a31d2dd8b34d0ffd0b59",
          "time": "2026-09-17T02:49:53+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Chair Warsh: In aggregate, we're more or less at full employment."
        },
        {
          "id": "6e45329500e80bfda43034a473a8b6b3769aa09773520d65500c769fbc04c74d",
          "time": "2026-09-17T02:51:09+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Chair Warsh: Other advanced economies are suffering from price pressures, too."
        },
        {
          "id": "2d9ddbdffec3df680156271cb92308450efbc207dc90f4928f877b85ca4c68e5",
          "time": "2026-09-17T02:54:27+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Chair Warsh: I see 3 reasons bond yields have risen: the first is economic strength, the second is competition for capital, the surge in CAPEX is real, and the third is geopolitics."
        },
        {
          "id": "87dadfab6e8c058b38124c2c6d701c7bdb88f98937850f8edea62044c922030f",
          "time": "2026-09-17T02:59:06+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Chair Warsh: I don't believe we need to do harm to the job market to achieve our objective."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
